  offerText: I found these wild mushrooms in the park. Free food! Eating them will
    boost your vitality and make you feel completely amazing.
  acceptResultText: You eat the mushrooms. They taste earthy, and you suddenly feel
    incredibly energized!
  rejectResultText: You skip the meal and go to bed hungry. Your stomach growls painfully
    all night.
  acceptedDelayedText: The energy wears off and the food poisoning begins. You spend
    the next day locked in the bathroom in agony.
